The standard oxidation potential \(E^{\circ}\) for the half cell reaction are
\[
\begin{array}{ll}
\mathrm{Zn} \rightarrow \mathrm{Zn}^{2+}+2 e^{-} ; & E^{\circ}=+0.76 \mathrm{~V} \\
\mathrm{Fe} \rightarrow \mathrm{Fe}^{2+}+2 e^{-} ; & E^{\circ}=+0.41 \mathrm{~V}
\end{array}
\]
